            "review_title": "Review at Ichiro BBQ",
            "review_text": "The Frant Massive\n6 contributions\n0\nAmazing Asian restaurant.\nDec 2019 • Family\nThis restaurant is sooooo good! Cook meat on your own BBQ at your table, and it was marinated in an super tasty sauce. The soup was amazing too. I don’t know why this restaurant isn’t on the map yet, but it should be. I wish there was one in London.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 1, 2020\nIchiro BBQ\nGreetings @thefrantmassive, \n\nOn behalf of ICHIRO BBQ, we would like to thank you very much for your feedback. We strive to keep up the quality of the food as well as service to give customers the best experience. We hope that we can serve you and your family again in the future. \n\nBest Regards,\nICHIRO BBQ\nRead more\nWritten January 6, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
